An AI-powered chatbot built using Python, Flask and Anthropic Claude.
The project provides a conversational AI interface and includes
an email-report tool that allows the AI agent to send reports
or messages through email.

---

## 🚀 Features

- AI-powered chatbot
- Anthropic Claude integration
- Web-based chat interface
- AI Agent architecture
- Tool/function calling
- Email report generation
- SMTP email integration
- Environment variable based API security

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```text
User
 |
 v
Chat Interface
 |
 v
Flask API
 |
 v
AI Agent
 |
 +------> Anthropic Claude
 |
 +------> Send Report Email
 |
 v
Response
📁 Project Structure
JA-Assure-Chatbot/
│
├── app.py
├── agent.py
├── email_tool.py
├── config.py
├── requirements.txt
├── .env.example
├── .gitignore
└── README.md
⚙️ Installation
1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/JA-Assure-Chatbot.git
2. Enter the project
cd JA-Assure-Chatbot
3. Create virtual environment
python3 -m venv venv
4. Activate virtual environment

Linux / macOS:

source venv/bin/activate

Windows:

venv\Scripts\activate
5. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
🔐 Environment Variables

Create a .env file.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_api_key

SMTP_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587

EMAIL_USERNAME=your_email@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASSWORD=your_app_password
▶️ Run the application
python3 app.py

Open:

http://127.0.0.1:5000
💬 Example

User:

Hello

AI:

Hello! How can I help you today?

User:

Send this report to example@gmail.com

The AI agent can call the email tool and send the requested
information.

🛡️ Security

Never upload API keys or passwords to GitHub.

Use:

.env

for secrets and keep it inside .gitignore.

